79671e6f0d9148f9b8b5f68b75","github_link":"https://github.com/andremichelle/openDAW/commit/f41aad0a0d618879671e6f0d9148f9b8b5f68b75","commit_subject":"The WebCLAP update also moves user presets to the newer builds and names what keeps an old build. A preset holding a WebCLAP device kept its old build in use, so the deletion skipped it and the update bubble never went. Presets are rewritten like projects (their header kept, the device reading its state); an old build still in use after the update is listed with its users in a dialog.","ai_tool":"Claude"}]